[size=6][b][color=#1084D0]KETAMINE++[/color][/b][/size]
[size=4]Trainer, FOV editor, minimap, game fixes, jump & bunny hop: one native DLL for Clive Barker's Hellraiser: Revival.[/size]
[size=3]No UE4SS. No launcher. Press [b][color=#1084D0]F1[/color][/b] or [b][color=#1084D0]F8[/color][/b], or pick [b]KETAMINE++[/b] in the game's pause menu.[/size]

[url=https://github.com/rams95blue/KETAMINE-PlusPlus][b]Source code on GitHub[/b][/url]  ·  [url=https://github.com/rams95blue/KETAMINE-PlusPlus/releases][b]Releases[/b][/url]  ·  [url=https://github.com/rams95blue/KETAMINE-PlusPlus/issues][b]Report a bug[/b][/url]  ·  [url=https://github.com/rams95blue][b]rams95 on GitHub[/b][/url][/center]

[line]

[size=4][b][color=#1084D0]What is it[/color][/b][/size]
KETAMINE++ bundles five community mods and a trainer into one file, rewritten natively (no UE4SS, no Lua), with new features on top. Every mod it is built on is credited and linked below: go give them an endorsement.

[list]
[*][b]Ketamine Menu[/b] by omxga: the trainer it is built on ([url=https://www.nexusmods.com/clivebarkershellraiserrevival/mods/27]Nexus[/url] · [url=https://github.com/literalynn/Hellraiser-Revivals-Ketamine-Menu]GitHub[/url])
[*][b]TrueFOV[/b] by Reynbow: the FOV editor ([url=https://www.nexusmods.com/clivebarkershellraiserrevival/mods/12]Nexus[/url] · [url=https://github.com/Reynbow/HellraiserFOV]GitHub[/url])
[*][b]ToolInputFix[/b], [b]KeypadInputFix[/b], [b]SpeedUpInteractions[/b], [b]QuickInteract[/b], [b]CutsceneAutoSkip[/b] by uwumatic101 ([url=https://www.nexusmods.com/clivebarkershellraiserrevival/mods/42]42[/url] · [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/clivebarkershellraiserrevival/mods/43]43[/url] · [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/clivebarkershellraiserrevival/mods/44]44[/url] · [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/clivebarkershellraiserrevival/mods/45]45[/url] · [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/clivebarkershellraiserrevival/mods/46]46[/url])
[*][b]Hellraiser True Minimap[/b] by Thidrec ([url=https://www.nexusmods.com/clivebarkershellraiserrevival/mods/39]Nexus[/url]), rebuilt without its stutter
[/list]

